        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "# Retail Creator Network",
          "",
          "Bob Green, the graph specialist at Seer Sporting Goods, is preparing evidence for Monday's demand and fulfillment review. The team has seen product signals; Bob now asks which creators are connected and which have a recorded relationship with the same brand.",
          "",
          "Estimated time: 15 minutes, plus optional in-memory exploration.",
          "",
          "### Objectives",
          "",
          "- Compare direct links and one-to-two-hop brand reach in SQL result tables.",
          "- Follow one creator's outgoing connections, then inspect those same links in a graph.",
          "- Compare a brand's recorded promotion relationships as rows and as a shared-brand map.",
          "- Distinguish stored relationship evidence from audience overlap or causal sales impact.",
          "",
          "Start with the two ranked overview tables. Then use the paired evidence tables and visualizations for creator 1 and brand 1. Each pair applies the same graph pattern and filter; its table explains the properties on the vertices and edges you inspect in the map.",
          ""
        ],
        "result": null,
        "visualizationConfig": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": "Direct creator connections",
        "hasTitle": true,
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT from_creator AS \"From Creator\",",
          "       to_creator AS \"To Creator\",",
          "       connection_type AS \"Link\",",
          "       strength AS \"Strength\"",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE ( LLUSER.INFLUENCER_NETWORK",
          "  MATCH (src IS influencer) -[e IS connects_to]-> (dst IS influencer)",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    src.handle AS from_creator,",
          "    dst.handle AS to_creator,",
          "    e.connection_type AS connection_type,",
          "    e.strength AS strength",
          "  )",
          ")",
          "ORDER BY strength DESC, from_creator, to_creator",
          "FETCH FIRST 5 ROWS ONLY;"
        ],
        "result": null,
        "visualizationConfig": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": "Brand relationships over two creator hops",
        "hasTitle": true,
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT DISTINCT brand_name AS \"Brand\",",
          "       promoter AS \"Promoter\",",
          "       reached AS \"Reached\",",
          "       relationship_type AS \"Relationship\"",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE ( LLUSER.INFLUENCER_NETWORK",
          "  MATCH (b IS brand) <-[p IS promotes]- (i IS influencer) -[c IS connects_to]->{1,2} (j IS influencer)",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    b.brand_name AS brand_name,",
          "    i.handle AS promoter,",
          "    j.handle AS reached,",
          "    p.relationship_type AS relationship_type",
          "  )",
          ")",
          "ORDER BY brand_name, promoter, reached, relationship_type",
          "FETCH FIRST 5 ROWS ONLY;"
        ],
        "result": null,
        "visualizationConfig": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": "Read the visual map",
        "hasTitle": true,
        "selectedVisualization": "html",
        "hideCode": true,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "### Follow creator 1's connections",
          "",
          "Bob starts with creator 1, `@trail_maya_1`. The `CONNECTS_TO` edge points from this creator to a reached creator. This is a narrower question than the strongest connections across the whole network in the opening table.",
          "",
          "Run **Creator 1: connection evidence**. Each row returns the source and reached creator IDs and handles, the connection type, the stored strength, and the recorded interaction count. The query includes every outgoing connection from creator 1; it applies no top-five cutoff.",
          "",
          "**Expected output: Recorded connections for creator 1**",
          "",
          "| Column | What to inspect |",
          "| --- | --- |",
          "| SOURCE_CREATOR_ID, SOURCE_CREATOR | The selected creator, 1 / @trail_maya_1 |",
          "| REACHED_CREATOR_ID, REACHED_CREATOR | The creator at the destination of the edge |",
          "| CONNECTION_TYPE, STRENGTH | The type and stored weight of the connection |",
          "| INTERACTION_COUNT | The interaction count recorded on that edge |",
          "",
          "Next run **Creator 1: connection map**. It uses the same `MATCH` pattern and creator filter, but returns `VERTEX_ID` and `EDGE_ID` values for the visualizer. Select a vertex and compare its `HANDLE` with the table. Select an edge and compare `CONNECTION_TYPE`, `STRENGTH`, and `INTERACTION_COUNT`.",
          "",
          "The stored connection explains why two creators appear together. It does not count the people who saw a campaign or establish that a connection caused a purchase."
        ],
        "result": null,
        "visualizationConfig": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": "Creator 1: connection evidence",
        "hasTitle": true,
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT source_creator_id,",
          "       source_creator,",
          "       reached_creator_id,",
          "       reached_creator,",
          "       connection_type,",
          "       strength,",
          "       interaction_count",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (LLUSER.INFLUENCER_NETWORK",
          "  MATCH (src IS influencer)-[e IS connects_to]->(dst IS influencer)",
          "  WHERE src.influencer_id = 1",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    src.influencer_id AS source_creator_id,",
          "    src.handle AS source_creator,",
          "    dst.influencer_id AS reached_creator_id,",
          "    dst.handle AS reached_creator,",
          "    e.connection_type AS connection_type,",
          "    e.strength AS strength,",
          "    e.interaction_count AS interaction_count",
          "  )",
          ")",
          "ORDER BY reached_creator_id, connection_type, strength DESC;"
        ],
        "result": null,
        "visualizationConfig": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": "Creator 1: connection map",
        "hasTitle": true,
        "selectedVisualization": "visualization",
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT *",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (LLUSER.INFLUENCER_NETWORK",
          "  MATCH (src IS influencer)-[e IS connects_to]->(dst IS influencer)",
          "  WHERE src.influencer_id = 1",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    vertex_id(src) AS source_id,",
          "    edge_id(e) AS connection_id,",
          "    vertex_id(dst) AS destination_id",
          "  )",
          ");"
        ],
        "result": null,
        "visualizationConfig": "[{\"visualization\": {\"height\": 480, \"ruleBasedStyles\": [{\"_id\": \"retail-influencer\", \"stylingEnabled\": true, \"visibilityEnabled\": true, \"target\": \"vertex\", \"component\": \"vertex\", \"type\": \"styling\", \"isDefaultRule\": true, \"conditions\": {\"operator\": \"and\", \"conditions\": [{\"property\": \"labels\", \"operator\": \"CONTAINS\", \"value\": \"INFLUENCER\"}]}, \"style\": {\"color\": \"#487a9a\", \"label\": {\"text\": \"${properties['HANDLE']}\", \"font\": {\"size\": 12}}}, \"legendTitle\": \"INFLUENCER\"}, {\"_id\": \"retail-brand\", \"stylingEnabled\": true, \"visibilityEnabled\": true, \"target\": \"vertex\", \"component\": \"vertex\", \"type\": \"styling\", \"isDefaultRule\": true, \"conditions\": {\"operator\": \"and\", \"conditions\": [{\"property\": \"labels\", \"operator\": \"CONTAINS\", \"value\": \"BRAND\"}]}, \"style\": {\"color\": \"#b15b3b\", \"label\": {\"text\": \"${properties['BRAND_NAME']}\", \"font\": {\"size\": 12}}}, \"legendTitle\": \"BRAND\"}], \"version\": 11}}]"
