        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "message": [
          "%md",
          "### Inspect a brand's promotion relationships",
          "",
          "Bob now centers the review on brand 1. The `PROMOTES` edges point from creators into the brand. This shared-brand question is different from following a creator-to-creator connection.",
          "",
          "Run **Brand 1: promotion evidence**, then **Shared brand: brand 1**. Both paragraphs use the same creator-to-brand pattern and `brand_id = 1` filter. The table makes the properties available for comparison before the map shows the shared center.",
          "",
          "**Expected output: Creators with recorded promotions for brand 1**",
          "",
          "| Column | What to inspect |",
          "| --- | --- |",
          "| BRAND_ID, BRAND_NAME | The selected brand's identifier and name |",
          "| CREATOR_ID, CREATOR_HANDLE | A creator with a promotion edge into this brand |",
          "| RELATIONSHIP_TYPE | The recorded type of promotion relationship |",
          "| POST_COUNT, AVG_ENGAGEMENT | Activity recorded on the promotion edge |",
          "| REVENUE_ATTRIBUTED | A stored attribution value; the graph does not establish causation |",
          "",
          "In the map, select the brand to read `BRAND_NAME` and a creator to read `HANDLE`. Follow the incoming edges and compare their `RELATIONSHIP_TYPE` values with the table. Several creators can promote the same brand without sharing the same audience."
        ],
        "result": null,
        "visualizationConfig": null
      },
      {
        "row": 0,
        "col": 0,
        "sizeX": 0,
        "width": 12,
        "title": "Brand 1: promotion evidence",
        "hasTitle": true,
        "selectedVisualization": "table",
        "hideCode": false,
        "hideResult": false,
        "hideGutter": true,
        "hideVizConfig": false,
        "hideInIFrame": false,
        "enabled": true,
        "forms": "[]",
        "relations": [],
        "dynamicFormParams": "{}",
        "message": [
          "%sql",
          "SELECT brand_id,",
          "       brand_name,",
          "       creator_id,",
          "       creator_handle,",
          "       relationship_type,",
          "       post_count,",
          "       avg_engagement,",
          "       revenue_attributed",
          "FROM GRAPH_TABLE (LLUSER.INFLUENCER_NETWORK",
          "  MATCH (creator IS influencer)-[promotion IS promotes]->(brand IS brand)",
          "  WHERE brand.brand_id = 1",
          "  COLUMNS (",
          "    brand.brand_id AS brand_id,",
          "    brand.brand_name AS brand_name,",
          "    creator.influencer_id AS creator_id,",
          "    creator.handle AS creator_handle,",
          "    promotion.relationship_type AS relationship_type,",
          "    promotion.post_count AS post_count,",
          "    promotion.avg_engagement AS avg_engagement,",
          "    promotion.revenue_attributed AS revenue_attributed",
          "  )",
          ")",
          "ORDER BY creator_id, relationship_type;"
        ],
        "result": null,
        "visualizationConfig": null
      },
